The directory pkg/bifrost_core/ contains a vendored, unmodified snapshot of
the "core" module of Maxim Bifrost (Go module github.com/maximhq/bifrost/core),
pinned to upstream commit 2c6f1328f6c4 (2026-08-06, "fail soft on
invalid_encrypted_content by stripping replayed..."). The snapshot was
verified file-by-file against that commit (go.mod, go.sum, utils.go, and
bifrost.go byte-identical); the upstream tree carries no per-file copyright
headers, so none are reproduced here.

The full text of the Apache License 2.0 governing this component is included
at pkg/bifrost_core/LICENSE, verbatim from the upstream repository.

This vendored module is currently not linked into the NerveGate binary; it is
retained for planned multi-provider routing support.
